<title>BANGLADESH: Bangladesh bourses closed for Eid al-Fitr holiday.</title>
<headline>Bangladesh bourses closed for Eid al-Fitr holiday.</headline>
<dateline>DHAKA 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bangladesh's main Dhaka Stock Exchange (DSE) and the Chittagong Stock Exchange were closed on Thursday for the start of the Moslem Eid al-Fitr holiday.</p>
<p>The DSE all-share price index closed 8.56 points or 0.47 percent down at 1,797.64 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The market will reopen on February 12.</p>
<p>-- Dhaka Newsroom +880-2-506363</p>
</text>
